  "adapterObligations": [
    "All mode changes and explicit selection reject requested-active or recovery state.",
    "Create/edit validate currently eligible Android launchable apps; pure target syntax is not installed-app safety evidence.",
    "Owner extension 2026-10-11: UI creation selects the new mode atomically after a successful save. Editing an existing mode preserves selection. A schedule resolves its own mode and never changes that selection.",
    "Deleting the recent mode clears the remembered ID and never selects another. Zero modes remain zero; deleted defaults are not recreated.",
    "Migrate legacy data only when no mode catalog exists; empty or dangling saved catalogs never invoke legacy migration.",
    "An active session keeps its fixed target snapshot; stopping remains independent of mode lookup.",
